Depends: python3, python3-pyqt6, python3-qrcode, python3-pil, python3-requests
Description: Next-Gen Smartboard & Screen Annotation System for Pardus 23
 Gen Pen is a modern interactive whiteboard tool featuring an edge-to-edge
 canvas, animated floating dock, 6-digit PIN mobile question transfer,
 and bundled Google Material Design 3 icons.
